// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 6.  Health check function
//
//     Acquires a client directly (not via pool.query) so we can distinguish
//     between "pool is full / timed out" and "the database is actually down".
//     Returns a plain object that is safe to serialise straight into an HTTP
//     response body (e.g. GET /health).
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

